{"id":"u06","level":"A1","emoji":"⏰","title":{"t":"Mein Tag","s":"My day","a":"audio/de-en/0f2f06ce51c5.mp3"},"goals":["Ask and tell the time (full hours, half hours, quarters)","Talk about your daily routine","Use separable verbs like aufstehen and einkaufen","Put the verb in second position"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"die Uhr","pl":"die Uhren","s":"clock; watch","emoji":"🕒","ex":{"t":"Das ist meine Uhr.","s":"This is my watch.","a":"audio/de-en/44ac96046c06.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f552.svg","a":"audio/de-en/390a4069dbd2.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/f137d676e2e3.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"der Morgen","pl":"die Morgen","s":"morning","emoji":"🌅","ex":{"t":"Guten Morgen, Mama!","s":"Good morning, Mom!","a":"audio/de-en/1bd837bb78c2.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f305.svg","a":"audio/de-en/9b3347f9be79.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/b498f907da63.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"der Abend","pl":"die Abende","s":"evening","emoji":"🌆","ex":{"t":"Guten Abend, Frau Müller!","s":"Good evening, Ms. Müller!","a":"audio/de-en/abcbeb10bf8c.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f306.svg","a":"audio/de-en/2be06bf7d704.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/3a94bc661a8d.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"das Mittagessen","pl":"die Mittagessen","s":"lunch","emoji":"🍽️","ex":{"t":"Das Mittagessen ist um zwölf Uhr.","s":"Lunch is at twelve o'clock.","a":"audio/de-en/259c0cf9a4f4.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f37d.svg","a":"audio/de-en/59fe49dbb869.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/ea39ff9374cb.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"aufstehen","s":"to get up","emoji":"⏰","ex":{"t":"Ich stehe um sechs Uhr auf.","s":"I get up at six o'clock.","a":"audio/de-en/5a44a0f8fecc.mp3"},"img":"img/e/23f0.svg","a":"audio/de-en/fc8641e127a5.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"frühstücken","s":"to have breakfast","emoji":"🍳","ex":{"t":"Wir frühstücken um sieben Uhr.","s":"We have breakfast at seven o'clock.","a":"audio/de-en/66dc2af38b0c.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f373.svg","a":"audio/de-en/cde838e3dce5.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"arbeiten","s":"to work","emoji":"💼","ex":{"t":"Mein Vater arbeitet jeden Tag.","s":"My father works every day.","a":"audio/de-en/baf23178c33c.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4bc.svg","a":"audio/de-en/539c038582e5.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"einkaufen","s":"to go shopping","emoji":"🛒","ex":{"t":"Am Abend kaufe ich ein.","s":"In the evening I go shopping.","a":"audio/de-en/cf062c5d96eb.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f6d2.svg","a":"audio/de-en/0ff0cc8bb2b8.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"anrufen","s":"to call (on the phone)","emoji":"📞","ex":{"t":"Ich rufe meine Mutter an.","s":"I call my mother.","a":"audio/de-en/345e8e4f24f0.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4de.svg","a":"audio/de-en/2382335f3637.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"fernsehen","s":"to watch TV","emoji":"📺","ex":{"t":"Am Abend sehen wir fern.","s":"In the evening we watch TV.","a":"audio/de-en/eab6e122e5dd.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4fa.svg","a":"audio/de-en/3cf7da1311f4.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"schlafen","s":"to sleep","emoji":"😴","ex":{"t":"Um elf Uhr schlafe ich.","s":"I go to sleep at eleven o'clock.","a":"audio/de-en/fa735a81b713.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f634.svg","a":"audio/de-en/e674fdc55ee7.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"halb","s":"half (halb acht = 7:30)","emoji":"🕢","ex":{"t":"Es ist halb acht.","s":"It's seven thirty.","a":"audio/de-en/ca4f320579ee.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f562.svg","a":"audio/de-en/35bf73c43500.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"spät","s":"late","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Oh, es ist spät!","s":"Oh, it's late!","a":"audio/de-en/dc4728e02a20.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/fa25c46e99a4.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"dann","s":"then","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich stehe auf. Dann frühstücke ich.","s":"I get up. Then I have breakfast.","a":"audio/de-en/e04b321bbc28.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/59a16b540e9d.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Wie spät ist es?","s":"What time is it?","a":"audio/de-en/11e519f596b8.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Es ist sieben Uhr.","s":"It's seven o'clock.","a":"audio/de-en/5ac27f83aad0.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Wann stehst du auf?","s":"When do you get up?","a":"audio/de-en/cd84631cfec3.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"um acht Uhr","s":"at eight o'clock","a":"audio/de-en/4e99a0d7480f.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"am Morgen / am Abend","s":"in the morning / in the evening","a":"audio/de-en/d4b5055d0711.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"jeden Tag","s":"every day","a":"audio/de-en/f1ec24302dc3.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Viertel nach drei","s":"a quarter past three","a":"audio/de-en/5cc6351b27a0.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"von acht bis vier Uhr","s":"from eight to four o'clock","a":"audio/de-en/d38661b91d19.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Wann stehst du auf?","s":"When do you get up?","a":"audio/de-en/cd84631cfec3.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Anna","voice":"f"},"B":{"name":"Reza","voice":"m"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Guten Morgen, Reza! Wie spät ist es?","s":"Good morning, Reza! What time is it?","a":"audio/de-en/2a486ad16386.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Guten Morgen, Anna! Es ist halb acht.","s":"Good morning, Anna! It's seven thirty.","a":"audio/de-en/e2788029da8d.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Wann stehst du auf?","s":"When do you get up?","a":"audio/de-en/f56004855f7e.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ich stehe um sechs Uhr auf. Dann frühstücke ich.","s":"I get up at six o'clock. Then I have breakfast.","a":"audio/de-en/6153ff5ed8de.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Und wann arbeitest du?","s":"And when do you work?","a":"audio/de-en/e01e9df2b2cf.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ich arbeite von acht bis vier Uhr. Und du?","s":"I work from eight to four o'clock. And you?","a":"audio/de-en/e68d7a8b563c.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Ich arbeite am Morgen. Am Abend kaufe ich ein.","s":"I work in the morning. In the evening I go shopping.","a":"audio/de-en/2ca967690dcb.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Am Abend sehe ich fern. Oh, es ist spät! Tschüss, Anna!","s":"In the evening I watch TV. Oh, it's late! Bye, Anna!","a":"audio/de-en/bc89b0db27ad.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"Wie spät ist es?","s":"Telling the time"},"explain":"To ask the time, say **Wie spät ist es?** or **Wie viel Uhr ist es?** The answer starts with **Es ist …**\nFull hours are easy: **Es ist sieben Uhr.** (7:00)\nHalf hours are tricky! German looks *forward* to the next hour: **halb acht** means \"halfway to eight\" = **7:30**, not 8:30.\nQuarters: **Viertel nach drei** (3:15) and **Viertel vor vier** (3:45).\nTo say *at* a time, use **um**: **um sieben Uhr** (at seven o'clock).","table":[["7:00","Es ist sieben Uhr."],["7:30","Es ist halb acht."],["3:15","Es ist Viertel nach drei."],["3:45","Es ist Viertel vor vier."],["12:00","Es ist zwölf Uhr."]],"examples":[{"t":"Es ist neun Uhr.","s":"It's nine o'clock.","a":"audio/de-en/13b4453b5c97.mp3"},{"t":"Es ist halb elf.","s":"It's ten thirty.","a":"audio/de-en/9f7833c14c85.mp3"},{"t":"Es ist Viertel nach zwei.","s":"It's a quarter past two.","a":"audio/de-en/57e5f73579c0.mp3"},{"t":"Wir essen um halb eins.","s":"We eat at twelve thirty.","a":"audio/de-en/8dfc7a7868ec.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"7:30 – Es ist ___.","options":["halb sieben","halb acht","sieben Uhr"],"answer":1,"s":"It's seven thirty.","full":"7:30 – Es ist halb acht.","a":"audio/de-en/f89ccbc208fe.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"3:15 – Es ist ___ nach drei.","options":["halb","Uhr","Viertel"],"answer":2,"s":"It's a quarter past three.","full":"3:15 – Es ist Viertel nach drei.","a":"audio/de-en/97bc7495313a.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Wir frühstücken ___ sieben Uhr.","options":["um","am","es"],"answer":0,"s":"We have breakfast at seven o'clock.","full":"Wir frühstücken um sieben Uhr.","a":"audio/de-en/66dc2af38b0c.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Wie ___ ist es?","answer":["spät","spaet"],"s":"What time is it?","full":"Wie spät ist es?","a":"audio/de-en/11e519f596b8.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"8:00 – Es ist acht ___.","answer":["Uhr"],"s":"It's eight o'clock.","full":"8:00 – Es ist acht Uhr.","a":"audio/de-en/f0e50cecbc75.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"4:30 – Es ist ___.","options":["halb vier","vier Uhr","halb fünf"],"answer":2,"s":"It's four thirty.","full":"4:30 – Es ist halb fünf.","a":"audio/de-en/27bb7d07ab52.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Es ist halb neun.","s":"It's eight thirty.","full":"Es ist halb neun.","a":"audio/de-en/e64d3d614d0c.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Wie spät ist es?","s":"What time is it?","full":"Wie spät ist es?","a":"audio/de-en/11e519f596b8.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"Ich stehe um sechs Uhr auf.","s":"Separable verbs & the verb in 2nd position"},"explain":"Some German verbs have a small front part (a prefix) that **separates**: **auf|stehen**, **ein|kaufen**, **an|rufen**, **fern|sehen**.\nIn a sentence, the main part of the verb gets the normal ending and the prefix jumps to the **end**: **Ich stehe um sechs Uhr auf.** (In the table, **ihr** is *you* for two or more friends or family members, and **sie** is *they*.)\nAnother key rule: in a German statement the verb is always the **second element**. If you start with a time, the subject moves behind the verb: **Um sechs Uhr stehe ich auf.** / **Am Abend sehen wir fern.**\nWatch out: a few verbs change their vowel with du and er/sie: **du siehst fern, er sieht fern**; **du schläfst, sie schläft**. And **arbeiten** adds an **e**: **du arbeitest, er arbeitet**.","table":[["ich","stehe … auf"],["du","stehst … auf"],["er / sie / es","steht … auf"],["wir","stehen … auf"],["ihr","steht … auf"],["sie / Sie","stehen … auf"]],"examples":[{"t":"Ich rufe meine Schwester an.","s":"I call my sister.","a":"audio/de-en/89499e86a0d3.mp3"},{"t":"Wann stehst du auf?","s":"When do you get up?","a":"audio/de-en/cd84631cfec3.mp3"},{"t":"Um sieben Uhr frühstücken wir.","s":"At seven o'clock we have breakfast.","a":"audio/de-en/9a718ae65848.mp3"},{"t":"Am Abend kauft Ali ein.","s":"In the evening Ali goes shopping.","a":"audio/de-en/c6b395cbd8be.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas sieht am Abend fern.","s":"Lukas watches TV in the evening.","a":"audio/de-en/877057861e0b.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Ich ___ um sechs Uhr auf.","options":["stehen","stehe","aufstehe"],"answer":1,"s":"I get up at six o'clock.","full":"Ich stehe um sechs Uhr auf.","a":"audio/de-en/5a44a0f8fecc.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Am Abend ___ wir fern.","options":["sehen","sieht","fernsehen"],"answer":0,"s":"In the evening we watch TV.","full":"Am Abend sehen wir fern.","a":"audio/de-en/eab6e122e5dd.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Sara ruft Ali ___.","answer":["an"],"s":"Sara calls Ali.","full":"Sara ruft Ali an.","a":"audio/de-en/1b45d075a3de.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Ich kaufe am Abend ___.","answer":["ein"],"s":"I go shopping in the evening.","full":"Ich kaufe am Abend ein.","a":"audio/de-en/02a8237a1cb5.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Um sieben Uhr ___.","options":["ich frühstücke","frühstücken ich","frühstücke ich"],"answer":2,"s":"At seven o'clock I have breakfast.","full":"Um sieben Uhr frühstücke ich.","a":"audio/de-en/6fcdca55d8ff.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Wann ___ du auf?","answer":["stehst"],"s":"When do you get up?","full":"Wann stehst du auf?","a":"audio/de-en/cd84631cfec3.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich stehe um sechs Uhr auf.","s":"I get up at six o'clock.","alts":["Um sechs Uhr stehe ich auf."],"full":"Ich stehe um sechs Uhr auf.","a":"audio/de-en/5a44a0f8fecc.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Am Abend sehen wir fern.","s":"In the evening we watch TV.","alts":["Wir sehen am Abend fern."],"full":"Am Abend sehen wir fern.","a":"audio/de-en/eab6e122e5dd.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Maryams Tag","s":"Maryam's day","a":"audio/de-en/c9a9e613f768.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Hallo! Ich heiße Maryam.","s":"Hello! My name is Maryam.","a":"audio/de-en/0430ce7222a8.mp3"},{"t":"Ich stehe jeden Tag um halb sieben auf.","s":"I get up at six thirty every day.","a":"audio/de-en/f92cefe555cd.mp3"},{"t":"Um sieben Uhr frühstücken Ali und ich.","s":"At seven o'clock Ali and I have breakfast.","a":"audio/de-en/3ae91404203a.mp3"},{"t":"Wir essen Brot und Käse. Ich trinke Tee.","s":"We eat bread and cheese. I drink tea.","a":"audio/de-en/df310ee95598.mp3"},{"t":"Dann arbeite ich von acht bis zwei Uhr.","s":"Then I work from eight to two o'clock.","a":"audio/de-en/06f4bd7f51e0.mp3"},{"t":"Am Abend kaufe ich ein.","s":"In the evening I go shopping.","a":"audio/de-en/cf062c5d96eb.mp3"},{"t":"Dann rufe ich meine Schwester an.","s":"Then I call my sister.","a":"audio/de-en/5b3593986ae3.mp3"},{"t":"Um zehn Uhr schlafe ich. Gute Nacht!","s":"I go to sleep at ten o'clock. Good night!","a":"audio/de-en/285e3ff6282f.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Wann steht Maryam auf?","s":"When does Maryam get up?","a":"audio/de-en/333ca1291b77.mp3"},"options":["um sieben Uhr","um halb sieben","um halb acht"],"answer":1},{"q":{"t":"Was trinkt Maryam?","s":"What does Maryam drink?","a":"audio/de-en/dd0c3ce1dbbe.mp3"},"options":["Tee","Kaffee","Milch"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Was macht Maryam am Abend?","s":"What does Maryam do in the evening?","a":"audio/de-en/5fa4c642a453.mp3"},"options":["Sie arbeitet.","Sie frühstückt.","Sie kauft ein."],"answer":2},{"q":{"t":"Wann schläft Maryam?","s":"When does Maryam go to sleep?","a":"audio/de-en/ed08ec25fe54.mp3"},"options":["um zwei Uhr","um zehn Uhr","um acht Uhr"],"answer":1}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Es ist Viertel nach sieben.","s":"It's a quarter past seven.","a":"audio/de-en/f69ad4f8438c.mp3"},{"t":"Ich stehe um sieben Uhr auf.","s":"I get up at seven o'clock.","alts":["Um sieben Uhr stehe ich auf."],"a":"audio/de-en/5647ba9c1591.mp3"},{"t":"Am Morgen trinke ich Tee.","s":"In the morning I drink tea.","alts":["Ich trinke am Morgen Tee."],"a":"audio/de-en/f7a3d7bad3d1.mp3"},{"t":"Herr Schmidt arbeitet jeden Tag.","s":"Mr. Schmidt works every day.","alts":["Jeden Tag arbeitet Herr Schmidt."],"a":"audio/de-en/b2ab4aa8beac.mp3"},{"t":"Das Mittagessen ist um halb eins.","s":"Lunch is at twelve thirty.","alts":["Um halb eins ist das Mittagessen."],"a":"audio/de-en/8e8c5662435f.mp3"},{"t":"Am Abend ruft Ali Sara an.","s":"In the evening Ali calls Sara.","alts":["Ali ruft am Abend Sara an.","Ali ruft Sara am Abend an."],"a":"audio/de-en/fc88537377ec.mp3"},{"t":"Wir sehen am Abend fern.","s":"We watch TV in the evening.","alts":["Am Abend sehen wir fern."],"a":"audio/de-en/a4f8a8b73bd4.mp3"},{"t":"Gute Nacht, Sara!","s":"Good night, Sara!","a":"audio/de-en/a67a099d656c.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/23f0.svg"}